OL,3,GNEWSARocket engineer aims to inspire
OL,4,Awomen to reach for the stars
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pilot and rocket engineer wants to
OL,7,Fuse her platform as a Miss England
OL,8,Ffinalist to encourage more women to
OL,9,Fconsider careers in science,
OL,10,Ftechnology, engineering and mathematics
OL,11,F(STEM).
OL,13,FMaleha Khan, 27, from Swanmore,
OL,14,FHampshire, has been flying since she
OL,15,Fwas 15 and is currently studying for a
OL,16,FPhD researching hydrogen rockets.
OL,18,FShe previously worked at the UK Space
OL,19,FAgency and dreams of one day travelling
OL,20,Finto space, having wanted to become an
OL,21,Fastronaut since childhood.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
