OL,3,GNEWSARocket engineer aims to inspire
OL,4,Awomen to reach for the stars
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut alongside her ambitions in
OL,7,Faerospace, Maleha is preparing to
OL,8,Fcompete in the Miss England final on
OL,9,FTuesday. The winner will go on to
OL,10,Frepresent the country at Miss World.
